</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Tis not enough to save our souls,</l><l>To shun th’ eternal fires;</l><l>The thought of God will rouse the heart</l><l>To more sublime desires.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God only is the creature’s home,</l><l>Though rough and straight the road;</l><l>Yet nothing less can satisfy</l><l>The love that longs for God.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Oh, utter but the Name of God</l><l>Down in your heart of hearts,</l><l>And see how from the world at once</l><l>All tempting light departs.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>A trusting heart, a yearning eye,</l><l>Can win their way above;</l><l>If mountains can be moved by faith,</l><l>Is there less power in love?</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>How little of that road, my soul!</l><l>How little hast thou gone!</l><l>Take heart, and let the thought of God</l><l>Allure thee further on.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>The freedom from all willful sin,</l><l>The Christian’s daily task;</l><l>Oh! these are graces far below</l><l>What longing love would ask!</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>The perfect way is hard to flesh;</l><l>It is not hard to love;</l><l>If thou wert sick for want of God,</l><l>How swiftly wouldst thou move!</l></lg>
<lg label="9."><l>Then keep thy conscience sensitive;</l><l>No inward token miss:</l><l>And go where grace entices thee—</l><l>Perfection lies in this.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
